{"id":"en_karma-strikes-my-wicked-ex-husband","title":"Karma Strikes My Wicked Ex-Husband","titleEn":"Karma Strikes My Wicked Ex-Husband","description":"Muriel Jones found herself bound to a love curse and under the control of her cruel husband, Zoey Shaw, who used her as a pawn while siphoning off her family's riches. He was unfaithful with her closest friend, Yvonne Fraser, and the two plotted together to seize the Jones family fortune. Everything changes when Barry Simpson, who has been mysteriously reborn carrying memories of a past life, helps Muriel escape her trap. The question that remains is whether retribution will at last find Zoey and Yvonne. Viewers can follow this series on Dramzio.","poster":"https://cdn1.nsstorage.space/karma-strikes-my-wicked-ex-husband/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn1.nsstorage.space/karma-strikes-my-wicked-ex-husband/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Rebirth","Scumbag-punishing","Gentleman","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d5btm/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_karma-strikes-my-wicked-ex-husband_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d5btm/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_karma-strikes-my-wicked-ex-husband_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d5btm/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_karma-strikes-my-wicked-ex-husband_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d5btm/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_karma-strikes-my-wicked-ex-husband_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"